[[2047,96,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply for the speedometer \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n10 of connector A) is controlled by the ignition (INT) by fuse line \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              of\nthe additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Similarly, the rev counter \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (at\npin 15 of connector A) and the centre instrument \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n1.).</p><p>An earth signal from instrument light dimmer\ncontrol \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               reaches pin 6 of connector B of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . This\nalso receives a side light activated signal, at pin 5 of connector\nB \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233770\">E2010</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>According to the logic processed by the\ninternal electronic device, the speedometer \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the\nlighting signal to the other instruments: to the centre instrument \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n7) from pin 12 of connector A;  and to the rev counter \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (3\nof connector B) from pin 4 of connector B.</p><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               has ideograms lit\nup when the side lights are switched on through the line coming\nfrom the switch for the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The zeroing signal for the trip meter reaches\npin 12 of connector B of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               located in \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234310\">E4021</a></p>"]]